&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1b895725cf38&quot;&gt;You are a U.S. person and able to work on &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;ITAR&lt;/span&gt;-controlled projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2105&quot; data-local-id=&quot;97841291b31c&quot;&gt;You have a &lt;span class=&quot;acronym-highlight&quot;&gt;BS&lt;/span&gt;/MS/PhD in a Computer Science, Engineering or related scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
